    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's an interesting way to put it, but doesn't that basically mean we're abandoning the idea of craft and skill? if the goal is just to deliver a message, then anyone can make \"art\" just by holding up a sign or making a statement. doesn't that devalue the actual technical mastery that used to define great artists?",
